1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
China's biggest lake sits 3,260 metres above the sea.
I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Qinghai Lake — over 4,500 square kilometres of blue.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
The road looping around it runs about 360 km.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Each summer the shore turns to gold rapeseed fields.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Double-tap if you'd drive this whole loop.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Cyclists take 3 to 4 days; drivers do it in one.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
★ Expert Tip: Come mid-July for flowers; pack for altitude.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Cycle the 360 km loop or drive it? Comment.
